// the heard form does not apply when the text already continues with
// the term's own continuation, and a pair that would not change the
// text is not logged as a correction.
// For a slash pair with several candidates, context can settle the
// choice: if the word right after the heard form is the last word of
// exactly one candidate (or the word right before is the first word of
// exactly one), that candidate replaces outright, the cue word is
